<title>USA: Gap names Fisher president of Gap division.</title>
<headline>Gap names Fisher president of Gap division.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gap Inc said it named Robert Fisher president of the company's Gap Division, responsible for the 1,300-store Gap, GapKids and babyGap businesses.</p>
<p>In the new role, Fisher, 42, who also is a director of the company, will continue to serve as a corporate executive vice president.</p>
<p>He will continue to report to Gap, Inc. President and Chief Executive Officer Millard Drexler.</p>
</text>
